"Artonans born into the wizard class feel authority naturally and begin training as toddlers."
"Artonan society ranks people from non-magical, to learners, to lowly wizards, up to knights."
"A bottom-rung wizard's life is held harder than an educated, important non-wizard's."
"Wizard kindergartens teach barefoot on cushions, with finger, breath and mouth exercises."
"Good wizard teachers find anything but in-person teaching insulting; distance teaching is rare."
"Wizard children are tested yearly for chaos potential, more often if their authority is high."
"Wizards resist chaos through their authority, but die like others as it frays."
"Wizards make their first contract when older, and contract tattoos mark a real wizard."
